# Landing credits (하단 크레딧)

Reference device: **iPhone 16** (393×852 logical px). Figma artboard **1277×2776** scales to viewport via `--landing-scale` (= `--vf-w` on phone).

Inside `.landing-canvas`, use **`--ld` (design px)** tokens from `tokens.css` — not raw `px` or `--vf` (canvas transform already scales to device).

Label inset **60** (`--landing-margin-x`), value column **217+903**.

## Partition gap (symmetric)

Above partition: `.landing-top` flex — `.landing-partition-gap` **flex-grows** (min `--landing-partition-min-gap`).

Below partition: mirror gap height from `syncLandingPartitionGaps()` → `--landing-partition-gap-sync`.

Do **not** use fixed `padding-top` on `.landing-credits__title` for partition spacing.

## Other vertical rhythm (design units × `--ld`)

| Measure | Figma |
|---------|-------|
| Line top → next section line top | **146** (`--landing-credits-section-gap`) |
| Spacer after a line box | gap − line-height (`--landing-credits-section-break`) — title padding-bottom, section-break |
| Canvas bottom inset | 146 |

## Web + logos

`--landing-web-logos-x` (673), `--landing-web-logos-top` (21), `--landing-web-logo-gap` (37).
